           bytes, 86 ak_ exports, sha256 887e0148e6afe809...
           **The LOADED object was confirmed from the dynamic linker, not the
           build log**, because this slice has been caught twice by a stale
           artifact and both times the linker said so when the build log did not:
             LD_DEBUG=libs ... | grep ak_core
             calling init: .../src/Harness/bin/Release/net8.0/libak_core.so
           and that file's sha256 equals the one cargo just wrote.
